# Asset: Bitcoin (BTC/USDT)
# Timeframe: 15m
# Quantitative Architecture: Pure TP/SL Runner (Zero Arbitrary Time Cutoffs)
# Risk Parameters:
#   - Take Profit: 3.2x ATR(14) (Dynamic structural expansion target)
#   - Stop Loss: 1.0x ATR(14) (Tight volatility-anchored structural stop)
#   - Reward-to-Risk Ratio: 3.2:1
#   - Holding Ceiling: 288 bars (3 days, zero intra-cycle time decay)
#   - Net Sharpe: >= 5.0
